WEBVTT

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:03.690
We've gone pretty far west, right?

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:06.060
This area has been abandoned.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.570
My dad's company went bankrupt,
and we couldn't stay.

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:14.660
It seems you can find happiness there.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:19.700
We can only protect the lives
of people by eliminating Horrors.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.790
I'm definitely going to
succeed once again in Russell City!

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.630
Fade away into the darkness!

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.180
Even if doing so
leaves behind a harsh reality,

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.180
it's impossible to remove all the pain.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:41.060
Let's go.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:00.120
Is that the Land of Guidance?

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:04.000
Probably. I don't really
know the details myself.

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:16.220
Looking over all the information
we've gathered until now,

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:19.140
El Dorado should be up ahead...

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:25.180
Somewhere in the middle of these mountains.

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:28.940
All the information
I gathered agrees with you.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:32.770
Even people further east of
the city have been gathering here.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.400
"You can find happiness in El Dorado."

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:40.370
"Your life is guaranteed to
be eternally free of hardships."

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:43.290
What is in El Dorado?

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.080
If we knew that, this 
wouldn't be so difficult.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.820
I was thinking of asking 
the Land of Guidance.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.390
The place of trial for Makai Alchemists?

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:55.460
Yes.

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:58.840
It's not far from our route.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:05.890
It's a secret place that's
only known to Makai Alchemists.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:09.730
Just like its name says,
it leads you to where you need to go.

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:12.060
Will it tell us about El Dorado?

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.030
No, if you don't have the qualifications,

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:17.400
you may be dropped down the mountain!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.450
What?!

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:23.580
You meanie!

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.580
Whoa! Stop!

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:26.620
We'll get in an accident!

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:22.820
This is as far as we go by car.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:36.420
People really live in a place like this?

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:42.090
Just a little more. Look.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:53.810
Ferre Salé Dessimo...

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.640
Amazing!

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:58.480
...the Makai Alchemist village of trials.

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:12.690
Wow! So fluffy!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:14.660
This stuff is amazing!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:19.060
The village is built on a
floating island made with woven reeds.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:26.780
They say Makai Alchemists made this
long ago to escape the unending fight.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:30.220
Their traditions continue to this day.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:36.520
The Madou tools we use are made here,
and we also research lost technology.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.810
Gina! Long time no see!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:41.610
How long are you staying this time?

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:45.360
Sorry. I just stopped by mid-mission.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.450
You've all grown.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.820
They let me on the fishing boats now!

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:53.160
Really? That's amazing.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:56.790
I'm learned how to make amulets!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.880
I see! Then, I'll have you
make one for me next time.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.300
I was wondering why things got so lively.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:07.220
It has been a long time,
Makai Alchemist Gina.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.090
Elder.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:11.600
It is rare for you to bring friends.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.970
A Makai Knight and...

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.040
I see.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:31.320
A little while back, a gun-wielding
alchemist came to take on the trial.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.160
Luke...

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:39.040
The rumors have even
reached our secluded village.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:44.590
It seems this El Dorado is quite a problem.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:54.810
We just developed that one.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.390
You can use it in a gun like normal,

00:06:56.390 --> 00:07:00.480
but a wide-spread explosion
can be invoked as is.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:01.940
Nice!

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:04.680
Thanks for the business.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:07.320
Any other new products?

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.740
What about this?

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:14.700
A monster gatling gun that shoots
6,000 alchemist rounds per minute.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.290
It's a bit pricy, but...

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:18.290
What do you think?

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:21.290
Not bad. I'll take that, too!

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.360
Thanks for the business!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:31.510
The Land of Guidance is farther
beyond this village, above a mountain.

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:37.220
Normally, only Makai Alchemists
are allowed to enter.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:42.940
This time, I will make a
special case for you and that girl.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:43.900
Are you sure?!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:48.820
That girl was born under a strange star.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:55.450
In the near future,
her actions will shake the world.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.920
Sword!

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:04.000
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.260
--It's amazing! It's so amazing!
--Huh?

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:12.560
When Gina goes shopping, she easily
dishes out crazy amounts of money!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:19.060
I wonder how many men she
made cry for those bundles of bills.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.520
Cry?

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.480
You're too young to understand, kid.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.940
I thought that Gina was cunning...

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.230
So this is what you meant.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:33.320
Well, she really knows how to use money.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:35.070
She's a bit too greedy, though!

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:35.820
Sword!

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:36.280
Huh?

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:37.950
Sorry for the wait.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.160
Did you finish talking with the Elder?

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.160
Y-Yeah.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.370
Gina... Are those Madou tools, too?

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.670
Oh, this?

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:49.210
No, it's just an accessory.

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:51.960
It's important to eliminate Horrors,

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:54.130
but I need to spend money on myself, too.

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:56.970
You only have one life.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.080
Some here, too!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:33.300
Here you are, dear.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:52.320
Have some more!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:02.080
Gina, you really love kids, huh?

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:05.500
Huh? Yes, you're right.

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.290
Though, it's more like I'm used to them.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.330
Used to them?

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.250
Me, too.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:13.420
I used to be in a home like you.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.590
Have you finished preparations?

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:58.550
Makai Alchemist. You, who wish
to challenge the Land of Guidance.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:02.310
May the correct path open up to you.

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:15.610
I wonder why Gina chose this path...

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:16.440
Hm?

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:20.240
I asked her, once before.

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.400
Thank you!

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:50.680
I never knew a world like this existed.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:56.190
Behind the scenes,
people risk their lives to fight

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:59.170
and make the weapons used to fight...

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:05.390
But no one knows anything about them.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.490
Even me...

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:12.210
It's better not knowing something like that.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.170
That's so lonely.

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.590
We're fine with that.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:30.060
We're happy as long as you normal
people live your lives out healthily!

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:48.520
This is the Land of Guidance?

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:55.920
We're almost there.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:05.470
It only appears on a full moon.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.970
The temple that connects
to the Land of Guidance.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.540
Gina, what's wrong?

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.430
There is an inscription.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:42.670
Those who seek guidance must display resolve.

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:57.360
This way!

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:09.990
Sword!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:14.950
This is Gina's trial.
It isn't my place to intervene.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.530
Gina!

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:41.000
I'll show you my resolve.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.210
I will do whatever it takes.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.170
I will eliminate Horrors!

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:53.970
If Horrors go against reason
and destroy our world...

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:58.390
Even if it means I must go against
reason and destroy everything myself,

00:15:58.390 --> 00:15:59.560
I will eliminate them!

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.860
She did it!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.700
Oh, mana of earth.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:18.490
Obey me and destroy the enemy before me!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:29.120
To dust!

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:48.230
You two all right?

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:51.490
Like hell we are!
You just did whatever you wanted--

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:55.990
Gina! Are you okay? Are you hurt?

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:57.300
I'm fine.

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.080
Is that from the monster?

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:05.500
A stone of protection.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:12.380
That which reflects all magic
and protects its wielder.

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:14.880
Though, heed this well.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:21.930
Only the unbending will of the
wielder shall bring forth its power.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.680
M-Mia?!

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:28.230
It has been a long time, Land of Guidance.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:32.780
The guardian of this 
temple is possessing Mia?

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:39.550
Yes. He is the Land of Guidance
that guides us Makai Alchemists.

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:44.330
Girl, who the darkness known as King desires.

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:49.080
Will you be the key to this calamity?

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.840
So you know about King.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:55.380
I am not omnipotent.

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:58.680
The knowledge I possess is small.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:02.510
However, his name is
carved in ancient prophecy.

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:08.360
The eternal being and the ring he forged.

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:14.820
It is such ancient, ancient evil.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:19.740
Countless times he has escaped
destruction. A creature of cunning.

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:23.700
Never does he use his power directly.

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:29.750
He enjoys watching others dance
and drown in the power he bestows.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:35.340
The ring is his crystallization of power.

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:39.390
He controls darkness and is darkness himself.

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:44.770
One who controls the
creatures known as Horrors freely.

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:50.190
That who possesses the
ring controls the horror within,

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:53.270
making any desire a reality.

00:18:54.110 --> 00:19:00.110
So this ancient being is using the ring
to control Knight and the Horrors?

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:04.580
A ring that controls
Horrors really does exist...

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:10.000
El Dorado is the capital
which King has established.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.880
I cannot yet see the reason.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:15.380
Yet, it is a Horror's action.

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:19.930
Surely a catastrophe
for mankind and their world.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:21.300
Oh, Land of Guidance.

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:24.610
Please show me the path to El Dorado.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:28.440
You, who have shown me resolve.

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:33.730
In the land southwest of this place
is a city men call El Sanvados.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:38.690
Further south, is a place
where darkness gathers.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.440
Heed well.

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.490
The truth is within that darkness.

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:47.700
Even with my sight, I cannot see...

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:50.540
...the depth of such deep darkness.

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:03.890
Sophie!

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.140
Brother?

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.310
Sophie!

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:07.890
Brother!

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.430
Sophie!

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:12.810
Wait! Brother!

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:19.780
Hey! Hey! Sophie!

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:23.780
What's wrong? You okay?

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:29.750
Sword... Yeah, I'm fine...

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:39.960
Whoa! What's happening?!

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.650
Oh! This place...

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.320
We've returned.

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:04.570
Yes. Good work, Mia.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:19.630
Sophie.

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:23.340
Take this as a protection charm.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:27.260
Huh?! But this is from your trial...

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:29.760
I already knew it a long time ago.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:34.270
The strength of my resolve,
and the path I must take.

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:42.270
I only wanted to ask the
Land of Guidance about El Dorado.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:46.060
So I will give that to you, Sophie.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.910
The Land of Guidance spoke.

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:03.670
Without strong will, it is just a pretty gem.

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:07.200
Your heart calls forth its power.
